Source repository only (not part of any published artifact)
  - jam/graalvm-annotations declares two annotation types whose names match GraalVM Native
    Image's @AlwaysInline and @NeverInline so that native-image recognises them at build time.
    The declarations are written here; no GraalVM source is included.
  - jinfer-jinja/src/test/resources/chat_templates: chat templates copied from the respective
    model repositories on Hugging Face, each under its model's own license, used only to check
    template rendering.
  - jinfer-chat LlamaCppGrammarCorpusTest: grammar cases from llama.cpp's
    tests/test-grammar-integration.cpp (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023-2024 The ggml authors).
  - toknroll-core/src/test/resources/ground_truth_tokens.json: generated with OpenAI's tiktoken
    (MIT).
  - jinfer-langchain4j/src/test/resources/kit-images: the two photos LangChain4j's compliance kit
    references, cat.png from Wikimedia Commons
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Felis_silvestris_silvestris_small_gradual_decrease_of_quality.png,
    see the file page for its license) and dice.png from the LangChain4j repository (Apache-2.0).
